# What `railway up` must never upload.
#
# `.gitignore` already excludes both of these and Railway honours it, so this
# file is the second lock rather than the first: `--no-gitignore` exists, and
# the day someone passes it this machine's secrets file and its whole ledger
# would go up with the source. `.railwayignore` is not overridable.
#
# `container.test.ts` reads the names from `installPaths()`, so renaming
# either one breaks the build here rather than on somebody else's disk.
.env
.agentlings/

# Untracked inputs and rendered measurements — nothing reads them at run time.
Artwork/
art/blender/
*.log
.claude/
